Package: crworkflows
Title: Concentration-Response Analysis Workflows for Commercial Ecotoxicology Laboratories
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Rebecca", "Fisher", email = "rebeccafisher76@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Example datasets, data validation, model fitting and reporting
    functions supporting standardised concentration-response analysis of routine
    ecotoxicological test types. Two independent fitting engines are supported:
    Bayesian multi-model averaging via 'bayesnec' and frequentist non-linear
    regression via 'drc'. Both engines are optional; install only the one in use.
